= Past exam of the MPhil in nuclear energy course of the University of Cambridge

The 2019 and 2021 NE2 papers match Engineering 4I10 papers with public worked cribs: https://teaching.eng.cam.ac.uk/system/files/Crib_4I10_2019.pdf[2019 crib] and https://teaching.eng.cam.ac.uk/system/files/4I10_Crib_2021.pdf[2021 crib]. The 2020 NE1 cover explicitly crosslists Engineering 4M16; https://teaching.eng.cam.ac.uk/content/teaching-opportunities[Engineering advertises student access to examination cribs for all years in its library]. These three papers are skipped for new solutions. Student-answer availability for the other held papers remains unverified.

